[en.FOCUS_C18_100_PREPARE_SENDAK]
Operation <=Protégé=>

[en.FOCUS_C18_100_PREPARE_SENDAK_desc]
No matter how Sendak treats us, we must be vigilant against the cult using black magic.\n“Trust, but verify”, we must always have a backup plan in case of emergencies.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_PREPARE_SENDAK]
「学徒」行动

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_PREPARE_SENDAK_desc]
无论僧达克对待我们的态度如何，我们必须要对那些使用黑魔法的密教保持警惕。\n“防人之心不可无”，我们总要做好后备计划，以防不测。

